  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healing Hands Christmas Luncheon With Love</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will be hosting a traditional Christmas Luncheon for 250 adult homeless member of the PE Metro. They will be brought in to our shelter early in the morning for a shower, a clean set of clothes and a haircut and a shave. They will then be treated to a full traditional luncheon, dessert station, tea/coffee bar. Father Christmas will be on hand to hand out gifts to all attendees. And we will have music, and games for entertainment. Healing Hands upholding the spirit of Giving.</narrative>
  </description>
